    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the general business law and the banking law, in relation to\nprohibiting a consumer reporting agency or lender from using certain\ninformation to determine an individual's credit worthiness",
    "basePrintNo": "S2302",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S2302-2019",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
